# Mouser Foundry: "When this artifact enters or leaves the battlefield, create a 1/1 colorless Robot artifact creature token."
# Bot1 casts it on turn 1 with Mox Ruby and Mox Jet (a Robot), then on turn 3 pays {4}{R} (Black Lotus' RRR and Sol Ring's {C}{C})
# and sacrifices it: it leaves the battlefield (a second Robot) and, its last known information the source, deals 3 damage to
# Bot2's Hill Giant, exactly lethal for a 3/3.

